PUT user:1 Sahil

arrives at node-0 - Main

1. check which shard does user:1 belongs to - KeyPartitioner
2. get the node that corresponds to that shard - ShardManager
3. check if it belongs to local node or not - RequestHandler + ClusterConfiguration
4. execute locally if local or else forward request to correct jvm - RequestHandler
5. respond the status to client - RequestHandler